    "src.wada.desc": "The Dictionary of Color Combinations: the reference, numbered 1 to 348.",
    "src.wada.note": "Sanzo Wada (1883–1967) published his combinations in 1933–1934 in <i>Haishoku Sōkan</i>, reissued in 2010 by Seigensha as <i>A Dictionary of Color Combinations</i>. Hex values come from HexPot's CMYK → HEX conversion: they are targets to check on your real material. <b>Faithful</b> match: OKLab gap ≤ 6; <b>close</b>: ≤ 12; <b>loose</b>: beyond.",
